(4931293, 716388, 57229, '<td valign="top">The over-exposure in the ball is too slight to really meet this challenge. The idea of the whole being ''borne out of light'' is nice, but I''m not 100% sure it''s working here.</td>', 'The over-exposure in the ball is too slight to really meet this challenge. The idea of the whole being ''borne out of light'' is nice, but I''m not 100% sure it''s working here.', '2008-09-03 13:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
