(4931358, 717568, 57229, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and great picture. It''s crying out for MDFGADH or whatever dislexics call HDR, but is it really overexposed. Ah, me - only on dpc could such a lovely picture be thought of as cheating.</td>', 'Beautiful light and great picture. It''s crying out for MDFGADH or whatever dislexics call HDR, but is it really overexposed. Ah, me - only on dpc could such a lovely picture be thought of as cheating.', '2008-09-03 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
