(4934840, 717532, 97073, '<td valign="top">Great clarity on the eye!</td>', 'Great clarity on the eye!', '2008-09-04 19:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934841, 717363, 84124, '<td valign="top">I like the intensity of the color of the foreground against the overexposed background.  That meets the challenge well.  It looks like your shot might be suffering a bit of chromatic abberation (especially in the center of the flower) though due to some lens flare, a less direct angle may have minimized it.  Regardless, a nice image to look at.</td>', 'I like the intensity of the color of the foreground against the overexposed background.  That meets the challenge well.  It looks like your shot might be suffering a bit of chromatic abberation (especially in the center of the flower) though due to some lens flare, a less direct angle may have minimized it.  Regardless, a nice image to look at.', '2008-09-04 19:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934855, 717146, 30612, '<td valign="top">not enough over exposure to me</td>', 'not enough over exposure to me', '2008-09-04 19:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934857, 717569, 30612, '<td valign="top">not enough over exposure to me</td>', 'not enough over exposure to me', '2008-09-04 19:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
