(4935064, 717010, 30454, '<td valign="top">Very nice expression on the boy''s face. At first I thought he really bend his body. Cleveer idea.</td>', 'Very nice expression on the boy''s face. At first I thought he really bend his body. Cleveer idea.', '2008-09-04 21:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
