(4935386, 715429, 81362, '<td valign="top">Overexposure enhances this nicely. Enjoy seeing color detail in this. Wish the bit of leaf around 4 oclock did not have to be turned upward. High score from me nevertheless.</td>', 'Overexposure enhances this nicely. Enjoy seeing color detail in this. Wish the bit of leaf around 4 oclock did not have to be turned upward. High score from me nevertheless.', '2008-09-05 00:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935390, 717603, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, although I would have liked seeing more of the top of the bouquet.</td>', 'Very pretty, although I would have liked seeing more of the top of the bouquet.', '2008-09-05 00:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935396, 717332, 81362, '<td valign="top">Artistic enough to frame for a gallery showing. Expect in top 10.</td>', 'Artistic enough to frame for a gallery showing. Expect in top 10.', '2008-09-05 00:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935399, 717175, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice choice for background, with the texture highlights a welcome break form the uniformly white alternatives. Clearly overexposed despite the preservation of color, meeting the challenge well.</td>', 'Nice choice for background, with the texture highlights a welcome break form the uniformly white alternatives. Clearly overexposed despite the preservation of color, meeting the challenge well.', '2008-09-05 00:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935421, 717554, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice high key shot. Having the two eyes such different tones throws it off a little.</td>', 'Nice high key shot. Having the two eyes such different tones throws it off a little.', '2008-09-05 00:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935432, 717565, 81362, '<td valign="top">The magnitude of the differences between the two eyes (size, shadows on both sides of the left eye globe but not the right) and the dilated pupils despite bright light make this a bit unsettling. If not due to photographic factors, a medical eye evaluation might be wise.</td>', 'The magnitude of the differences between the two eyes (size, shadows on both sides of the left eye globe but not the right) and the dilated pupils despite bright light make this a bit unsettling. If not due to photographic factors, a medical eye evaluation might be wise.', '2008-09-05 00:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935435, 716703, 81362, '<td valign="top">Having the dark horizontal lines look so much like a drawing or painting sets off the remaining greens and branches on the small island. Well done.</td>', 'Having the dark horizontal lines look so much like a drawing or painting sets off the remaining greens and branches on the small island. Well done.', '2008-09-05 00:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935438, 716457, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and nicely backlit. I predict higher scores from participants (who should recognize this as overexposed as well as backlit) than from nonparticipants (who may attribute all the bright areas to backlighting alone.</td>', 'Very pretty and nicely backlit. I predict higher scores from participants (who should recognize this as overexposed as well as backlit) than from nonparticipants (who may attribute all the bright areas to backlighting alone.', '2008-09-05 00:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935445, 717560, 81362, '<td valign="top">Interesting mix of overexposed left cheek and underexposed right cheek. Hope the voters don''t missread this just because the background is dark.</td>', 'Interesting mix of overexposed left cheek and underexposed right cheek. Hope the voters don''t missread this just because the background is dark.', '2008-09-05 00:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935457, 715557, 56254, '<td valign="top">this is a great example of how ''overexposed'' make an image stronger ... very well done ... good luck!<br/> <br/>edit to add to faves ... this is really outstanding ... good luck ...</td>', 'this is a great example of how ''overexposed'' make an image stronger ... very well done ... good luck! edit to add to faves ... this is really outstanding ... good luck ...', '2008-09-05 00:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935723, 717403, 54566, '<td valign="top">intriguing. theres a nice scatter all around to create interest.</td>', 'intriguing. theres a nice scatter all around to create interest.', '2008-09-05 05:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935725, 715536, 54566, '<td valign="top">love the calmness about this. cant find a single possibility of bettering</td>', 'love the calmness about this. cant find a single possibility of bettering', '2008-09-05 05:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935726, 717565, 54566, '<td valign="top">yes. this over-exposure brings the eyes to sudden notice. top 10.</td>', 'yes. this over-exposure brings the eyes to sudden notice. top 10.', '2008-09-05 05:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935740, 717520, 54566, '<td valign="top">nicely done. can  see the skin details clear.</td>', 'nicely done. can  see the skin details clear.', '2008-09-05 06:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935776, 717403, 53147, '<td valign="top">Excellent work Judi. Love how you kept Kitas hair dark but not black, yet the other details very black. The tree is a great touch.</td>', 'Excellent work Judi. Love how you kept Kitas hair dark but not black, yet the other details very black. The tree is a great touch.', '2008-09-05 06:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935777, 717183, 53147, '<td valign="top">This is what I want from an overexposed portrait. Works very well for me.</td>', 'This is what I want from an overexposed portrait. Works very well for me.', '2008-09-05 06:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935779, 717157, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice. An image where the overexposure truly has a positive impact on the image.</td>', 'Very nice. An image where the overexposure truly has a positive impact on the image.', '2008-09-05 06:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935780, 717669, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cool and ethereal. The overexposure really adds to the mood. Very nice.</td>', 'Cool and ethereal. The overexposure really adds to the mood. Very nice.', '2008-09-05 06:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935781, 717506, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great banmorn feel to this. I like how there is still some separation of the edge of the flowers and the background. Colors are very pleasing.</td>', 'Great banmorn feel to this. I like how there is still some separation of the edge of the flowers and the background. Colors are very pleasing.', '2008-09-05 06:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935782, 716642, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. The colors are great on this one. Saturated but not overly so. Love how his eyes stand out. Very good usage of overexposure.</td>', 'Very cool shot. The colors are great on this one. Saturated but not overly so. Love how his eyes stand out. Very good usage of overexposure.', '2008-09-05 06:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935783, 715522, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Great lighting. Overexposed but purposefully - which is more than I can say for alot of the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice image. Great lighting. Overexposed but purposefully - which is more than I can say for alot of the challenge. Well done.', '2008-09-05 07:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935784, 717214, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great and contrasty. Love the balance of the shot and you really used the theme of the challenge to the benefit of the image. Well done.</td>', 'Great and contrasty. Love the balance of the shot and you really used the theme of the challenge to the benefit of the image. Well done.', '2008-09-05 07:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935785, 717291, 53147, '<td valign="top">I am not really sure I would call this overexposed, but it is a beautiful image. The softness works great.</td>', 'I am not really sure I would call this overexposed, but it is a beautiful image. The softness works great.', '2008-09-05 07:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935786, 717542, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cute little girl but I must admit that the result achieved isnt what I was looking for in this challenge. A couple of blown highlights on her dress just doesnt cut it.</td>', 'Cute little girl but I must admit that the result achieved isnt what I was looking for in this challenge. A couple of blown highlights on her dress just doesnt cut it.', '2008-09-05 07:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935787, 716270, 53147, '<td valign="top">Not really what i am looking for from this challenge. Looks pretty well exposed.</td>', 'Not really what i am looking for from this challenge. Looks pretty well exposed.', '2008-09-05 07:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935795, 717683, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think you met the challenge here, but the image as a whole doesnt really grab me.</td>', 'I think you met the challenge here, but the image as a whole doesnt really grab me.', '2008-09-05 07:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935796, 716457, 53147, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, but the image doesnt really grab me. I am not sure if the overexposure is a strong benefit to the image.</td>', 'Fits the challenge, but the image doesnt really grab me. I am not sure if the overexposure is a strong benefit to the image.', '2008-09-05 07:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935797, 717688, 53147, '<td valign="top">Stunning detail on the bird. However I just dont see this image fitting the challenge well. The small area tat is overexposed seems just incidental.</td>', 'Stunning detail on the bird. However I just dont see this image fitting the challenge well. The small area tat is overexposed seems just incidental.', '2008-09-05 07:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935801, 715597, 53147, '<td valign="top">Well I think you met the challenge in having that area overexposed, but it doesnt really have a strong impact on the image. Overall it feels a bit flat.</td>', 'Well I think you met the challenge in having that area overexposed, but it doesnt really have a strong impact on the image. Overall it feels a bit flat.', '2008-09-05 07:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935806, 716380, 53147, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC! I hope you find it fun and semi addictive. Now to your image. I think you met the challenge in presenting something overexposed, but the image as a whole is a bit flat and not overly pleasing. There doesnt seem to be any main purpose to it. Not that there has to be in photography, but at DPC you really need something WOW like to grab the voter to keep him looking at your image for longer than 2 seconds. Dont fret over the low sores - we all get them. Just keep plugging away at your craft and learn all you can from this place. There is alot to take in at DPC.</td>', 'Welcome to DPC! I hope you find it fun and semi addictive. Now to your image. I think you met the challenge in presenting something overexposed, but the image as a whole is a bit flat and not overly pleasing. There doesnt seem to be any main purpose to it. Not that there has to be in photography, but at DPC you really need something WOW like to grab the voter to keep him looking at your image for longer than 2 seconds. Dont fret over the low sores - we all get them. Just keep plugging away at your craft and learn all you can from this place. There is alot to take in at DPC.', '2008-09-05 07:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
