(4937194, 717417, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Focus seems to be more on the book than the face.</td>', 'Good idea. Focus seems to be more on the book than the face.', '2008-09-05 21:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937196, 717739, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the exposure and processing, and it''s a great composition. The border''s too strong though. Until I covered it, I didn''t even notice that the stem was also in color.</td>', 'I like the exposure and processing, and it''s a great composition. The border''s too strong though. Until I covered it, I didn''t even notice that the stem was also in color.', '2008-09-05 21:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937201, 716841, 76335, '<td valign="top">Neat-o! Very stylish, great pose.</td>', 'Neat-o! Very stylish, great pose.', '2008-09-05 21:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937204, 717650, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s harsh on my eyes too! Seriously, it''s a bit much on the right.</td>', 'It''s harsh on my eyes too! Seriously, it''s a bit much on the right.', '2008-09-05 21:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937209, 717587, 76335, '<td valign="top">The sharpening is too much. Also, use all 150KB that you''re given when creating your JPG. I see some pixelization.</td>', 'The sharpening is too much. Also, use all 150KB that you''re given when creating your JPG. I see some pixelization.', '2008-09-05 21:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937218, 717710, 76335, '<td valign="top">Is the background overexposed? Doesn''t really do anything for the image (in fact I think a background, even a blurred one, would only help it).</td>', 'Is the background overexposed? Doesn''t really do anything for the image (in fact I think a background, even a blurred one, would only help it).', '2008-09-05 21:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937221, 717683, 76335, '<td valign="top">Points for the title anyway...</td>', 'Points for the title anyway...', '2008-09-05 22:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937226, 717710, 76598, '<td valign="top">great picture, just wish that post wasn''t in the background</td>', 'great picture, just wish that post wasn''t in the background', '2008-09-05 22:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937227, 717385, 76598, '<td valign="top">use all your pixels</td>', 'use all your pixels', '2008-09-05 22:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937229, 717146, 76598, '<td valign="top">great picture, overexposured?</td>', 'great picture, overexposured?', '2008-09-05 22:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937248, 715429, 76598, '<td valign="top">What an image.....magical.  You are the winner in my book.  I want to hear how you did this.</td>', 'What an image.....magical.  You are the winner in my book.  I want to hear how you did this.', '2008-09-05 22:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937252, 717260, 76598, '<td valign="top">Not to be harsh, but the image doesn''t seem to have a purpose.  It doesn''t strike me as abstract, so I am not sure what you were attempting.</td>', 'Not to be harsh, but the image doesn''t seem to have a purpose.  It doesn''t strike me as abstract, so I am not sure what you were attempting.', '2008-09-05 22:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937253, 717684, 76598, '<td valign="top">This might have worked had the eyes been in focus, but they aren''t</td>', 'This might have worked had the eyes been in focus, but they aren''t', '2008-09-05 22:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937254, 716333, 76598, '<td valign="top">not in focus</td>', 'not in focus', '2008-09-05 22:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937291, 717532, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the eye, but what''s it reflecting? If it''s to be that clear, it should be reflecting something interesting. Not sure the OE does much.</td>', 'Good focus on the eye, but what''s it reflecting? If it''s to be that clear, it should be reflecting something interesting. Not sure the OE does much.', '2008-09-05 23:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937306, 715536, 70164, '<td valign="top">Haven''t I already seen a photo of this same thing??? A few challenges ago. But I still like it. The water is so still. 8</td>', 'Haven''t I already seen a photo of this same thing??? A few challenges ago. But I still like it. The water is so still. 8', '2008-09-05 23:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937331, 715557, 81362, '<td valign="top">The overexposure and stubble of beard combine as the kind of pale cast associated with an illness or maybe just with late middle age (regardless of the actual facts of the subject). The combination makes for an interesting and thought provoking portrait.</td>', 'The overexposure and stubble of beard combine as the kind of pale cast associated with an illness or maybe just with late middle age (regardless of the actual facts of the subject). The combination makes for an interesting and thought provoking portrait.', '2008-09-05 23:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937332, 717010, 81362, '<td valign="top">Although a high key picture, I see this as also overexposed in a way that enhances the subject. I wonder if some cheerless portrait expert will whine that the pose makes the model look a little uncomfortable.</td>', 'Although a high key picture, I see this as also overexposed in a way that enhances the subject. I wonder if some cheerless portrait expert will whine that the pose makes the model look a little uncomfortable.', '2008-09-05 23:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937334, 717335, 81362, '<td valign="top">Lizards go well with too much sun. I like the shallow depth of field making the background almost shimmer.</td>', 'Lizards go well with too much sun. I like the shallow depth of field making the background almost shimmer.', '2008-09-05 23:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937340, 717264, 81362, '<td valign="top">Blown out enough to be simultaneously hard to look at and impossible not to keep examiing. Having half her mouth vanish gives an unreal almost ghostly effect.</td>', 'Blown out enough to be simultaneously hard to look at and impossible not to keep examiing. Having half her mouth vanish gives an unreal almost ghostly effect.', '2008-09-05 23:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937341, 717226, 81362, '<td valign="top">Effective use of light. Hope you reveal how much was in camera settings and how much post-processing.</td>', 'Effective use of light. Hope you reveal how much was in camera settings and how much post-processing.', '2008-09-05 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937342, 716252, 81362, '<td valign="top">Having the flower oriented downward makes this a fresh approach to a familiar subject. The overexposure makes me think of hot summer days.</td>', 'Having the flower oriented downward makes this a fresh approach to a familiar subject. The overexposure makes me think of hot summer days.', '2008-09-05 23:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937343, 717654, 81362, '<td valign="top">Centered subject works well, with the overexposure making a subtle, incomplete, internal frame.</td>', 'Centered subject works well, with the overexposure making a subtle, incomplete, internal frame.', '2008-09-05 23:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937369, 717417, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good book. Face and shirt overexposed with just the right touch of humor.</td>', 'Good book. Face and shirt overexposed with just the right touch of humor.', '2008-09-05 23:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937372, 717201, 81362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful high key portrait of, indeed, an adorable girl. Very pretty eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful high key portrait of, indeed, an adorable girl. Very pretty eyes.', '2008-09-05 23:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937380, 717680, 81362, '<td valign="top">Hot day, summer in the city? Having such a uniform pattern makes it hard for me to find anywhere for my eye to land. Not sure that I understand the intended enhancement of the overexposure.</td>', 'Hot day, summer in the city? Having such a uniform pattern makes it hard for me to find anywhere for my eye to land. Not sure that I understand the intended enhancement of the overexposure.', '2008-09-05 23:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937382, 716608, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice preservation of color - bright although overexposed. I''ll bet you wish basic editing rules would allow cloning out the tiny yellow streaks in the lower left hand corner.</td>', 'Nice preservation of color - bright although overexposed. I''ll bet you wish basic editing rules would allow cloning out the tiny yellow streaks in the lower left hand corner.', '2008-09-06 00:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937386, 717539, 81362, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle detail and shading preserved in the dark round window area as a powerful contrast to the long exposure whiteness of the towers.</td>', 'I like the subtle detail and shading preserved in the dark round window area as a powerful contrast to the long exposure whiteness of the towers.', '2008-09-06 00:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937388, 717183, 81362, '<td valign="top">Between exposure and processing this verges on the edge of looking like a line drawing. Expression of the model is hard to read, but at least it is thought provoking.</td>', 'Between exposure and processing this verges on the edge of looking like a line drawing. Expression of the model is hard to read, but at least it is thought provoking.', '2008-09-06 00:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937389, 717667, 81362, '<td valign="top">I think the overexposure enhances the texture of the wall as much as anything else in this image. Has a European feel to it. Looking forward to learning where you were.</td>', 'I think the overexposure enhances the texture of the wall as much as anything else in this image. Has a European feel to it. Looking forward to learning where you were.', '2008-09-06 00:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937391, 717683, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Challenging subject too. A little more overexposed might have displayed the statue better, but would have brightened the sky in a distracting way.</td>', 'Nice colors. Challenging subject too. A little more overexposed might have displayed the statue better, but would have brightened the sky in a distracting way.', '2008-09-06 00:06:56.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4937393, 717215, 81362, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen flowers overexposed in camera to the point of being reduced to ghostly petals. Doing this with graceful curved leaves is a nice variation.</td>', 'I''ve seen flowers overexposed in camera to the point of being reduced to ghostly petals. Doing this with graceful curved leaves is a nice variation.', '2008-09-06 00:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937397, 715195, 81362, '<td valign="top">The blurry guy givves me the creeps. Noticing the title reference to the B-29 that dropped the first atomic bomb gives a context for the intended effect. Good example of uncomfortable art.</td>', 'The blurry guy givves me the creeps. Noticing the title reference to the B-29 that dropped the first atomic bomb gives a context for the intended effect. Good example of uncomfortable art.', '2008-09-06 00:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937402, 715570, 81362, '<td valign="top">Blindfolded subject has a lot of artistic interest, but the green area on the lower right keeps drawing my eye away. Wish the green could be more like the building just above it.</td>', 'Blindfolded subject has a lot of artistic interest, but the green area on the lower right keeps drawing my eye away. Wish the green could be more like the building just above it.', '2008-09-06 00:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937403, 717474, 81362, '<td valign="top">Cropping away a chunk of the very bright sun area makes for a beautiful picture that is easier to look at, with the trees still overexposed enough to retain detail instead of turning into black outlines. Reasonable choice not to crop that way, as the voters would have even a harder time detecting the fit to the challenge.</td>', 'Cropping away a chunk of the very bright sun area makes for a beautiful picture that is easier to look at, with the trees still overexposed enough to retain detail instead of turning into black outlines. Reasonable choice not to crop that way, as the voters would have even a harder time detecting the fit to the challenge.', '2008-09-06 00:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937603, 717378, 60862, '<td valign="top">I would''ve loved this if you''d cropped out the green in the upper right.  As it is, I still like it.</td>', 'I would''ve loved this if you''d cropped out the green in the upper right.  As it is, I still like it.', '2008-09-06 03:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937612, 717536, 60862, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of this image:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=226758" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/374/120/226758.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/374/120/226758.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/374/120/226758.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/> <br/>I like the composition of this, but I prefer the starker tones of the other one.</td>', 'Reminds me of this image:   I like the composition of this, but I prefer the starker tones of the other one.', '2008-09-06 03:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937654, 716416, 18197, '<td valign="top">imho, it would be better w/o the [explitive deleted] wings. You ruined an otherwise wonderful photo.</td>', 'imho, it would be better w/o the [explitive deleted] wings. You ruined an otherwise wonderful photo.', '2008-09-06 03:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937657, 717587, 18197, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it was natural, or maybe it was a pp artifact, but I don''t like the halo.</td>', 'Perhaps it was natural, or maybe it was a pp artifact, but I don''t like the halo.', '2008-09-06 03:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937681, 717146, 18197, '<td valign="top">dnmc ... while I recognize the window is over exposed, imho, it doesn''t really use over exposure to make the shot.</td>', 'dnmc ... while I recognize the window is over exposed, imho, it doesn''t really use over exposure to make the shot.', '2008-09-06 03:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937682, 715273, 18197, '<td valign="top">while you''ve over exposed (blown out) certain aspects of the photo, it doesn''t really make the shot. dnmc, imho. Absent the challenge theme, and if you backed off a bit on the lighting, it would be alovely photo.</td>', 'while you''ve over exposed (blown out) certain aspects of the photo, it doesn''t really make the shot. dnmc, imho. Absent the challenge theme, and if you backed off a bit on the lighting, it would be alovely photo.', '2008-09-06 04:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937684, 715121, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like that I am struggling to figure out this photo. I like ambiguity.<br/> <br/>Having said that, I don''t feel you''ve really met the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'I like that I am struggling to figure out this photo. I like ambiguity. Having said that, I don''t feel you''ve really met the spirit of the challenge.', '2008-09-06 04:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937685, 717461, 18197, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, and there''s a certain element of humor here which I like, but I''m not resonating with the subject and the pp. Sorry.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, and there''s a certain element of humor here which I like, but I''m not resonating with the subject and the pp. Sorry.', '2008-09-06 04:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937687, 716753, 18197, '<td valign="top">A perfectly exposed photo ... what''s over exposed? And I might add ... a nice subject, great composition, with a complete emotional payload. Well done! But dnmc, imho.</td>', 'A perfectly exposed photo ... what''s over exposed? And I might add ... a nice subject, great composition, with a complete emotional payload. Well done! But dnmc, imho.', '2008-09-06 04:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937688, 717727, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the oversaturated post processing resulting in an abstract presentation. But dnmc imho.</td>', 'Love the oversaturated post processing resulting in an abstract presentation. But dnmc imho.', '2008-09-06 04:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937689, 717024, 18197, '<td valign="top">Subject well exposed. Dnmc imho.</td>', 'Subject well exposed. Dnmc imho.', '2008-09-06 04:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937690, 717474, 18197, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Love the light! Sillhouette is terrific.</td>', 'Gorgeous! Love the light! Sillhouette is terrific.', '2008-09-06 04:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937691, 715442, 18197, '<td valign="top">I really like graffitti. And you have turned this tag into fine art! Well done.</td>', 'I really like graffitti. And you have turned this tag into fine art! Well done.', '2008-09-06 04:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937692, 715536, 18197, '<td valign="top">Perfect match for the challenge theme. And a lovely abstract image.</td>', 'Perfect match for the challenge theme. And a lovely abstract image.', '2008-09-06 04:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937694, 717520, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract image and a perfect match for the challenge! Your preservation of color and texture is extraordinary! Well done.</td>', 'Lovely abstract image and a perfect match for the challenge! Your preservation of color and texture is extraordinary! Well done.', '2008-09-06 04:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
