(4940742, 717565, 76335, '<td valign="top">I hate the border. That said, the shot is beautiful. I hope you post your post-processing steps.</td>', 'I hate the border. That said, the shot is beautiful. I hope you post your post-processing steps.', '2008-09-07 22:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940744, 717600, 76335, '<td valign="top">The red cast is too much.</td>', 'The red cast is too much.', '2008-09-07 22:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940748, 717204, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not terribly interesting. If it''s about the buidling the cars and people take something from the shot. The lighting isn''t bad though.</td>', 'Not terribly interesting. If it''s about the buidling the cars and people take something from the shot. The lighting isn''t bad though.', '2008-09-07 22:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940750, 717252, 76335, '<td valign="top">The OE doesn''t add anything to this shot, in my opinion. Your model''s face is underexposed and the OE only accentuates that. Technicals aside, it''s a good candid shot.</td>', 'The OE doesn''t add anything to this shot, in my opinion. Your model''s face is underexposed and the OE only accentuates that. Technicals aside, it''s a good candid shot.', '2008-09-07 22:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940781, 715121, 76335, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one. Not sure what to think. I love the colors; they''re cold and mortifying. The window/door in the background is a bit distracting. Also, it''s not clear what your model is resting her (?) hand on, so it has some contextual problems.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one. Not sure what to think. I love the colors; they''re cold and mortifying. The window/door in the background is a bit distracting. Also, it''s not clear what your model is resting her (?) hand on, so it has some contextual problems.', '2008-09-07 22:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940792, 717611, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but I don''t see the OE.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but I don''t see the OE.', '2008-09-07 23:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940802, 715067, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting. This won''t do well, I''m sure you know by now, but it is an interesting abstract.</td>', 'Interesting. This won''t do well, I''m sure you know by now, but it is an interesting abstract.', '2008-09-07 23:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940805, 717335, 76335, '<td valign="top">Processing is harsh, but I like where you were going with this. The OE brings out some great shapes and textures, and I love the colors here.</td>', 'Processing is harsh, but I like where you were going with this. The OE brings out some great shapes and textures, and I love the colors here.', '2008-09-07 23:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940811, 715103, 76335, '<td valign="top">Overexposed, but to no good effect. Not much of interest here.</td>', 'Overexposed, but to no good effect. Not much of interest here.', '2008-09-07 23:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940815, 717697, 76335, '<td valign="top">It is blank indeed. The framing doesn''t do much, as there''s not enough contrast in the picture to allow it any impact. Looks like you were going for an old Polaroid instant look.</td>', 'It is blank indeed. The framing doesn''t do much, as there''s not enough contrast in the picture to allow it any impact. Looks like you were going for an old Polaroid instant look.', '2008-09-07 23:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940817, 717684, 76335, '<td valign="top">Needs some sharpness, focus, clarity.</td>', 'Needs some sharpness, focus, clarity.', '2008-09-07 23:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940821, 715570, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good idea and kind of eerie. Wish you had spent a bit more time working on the background. What is the black thing lower center?</td>', 'Good idea and kind of eerie. Wish you had spent a bit more time working on the background. What is the black thing lower center?', '2008-09-07 23:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940823, 716995, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully seen and a good crop too. Nice processing.</td>', 'Beautifully seen and a good crop too. Nice processing.', '2008-09-07 23:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
