(4943359, 716380, 72068, '<td valign="top">You need to think about the composition a little more, the trees would have looked nicer if you didn''t have the house in-shot, and perhaps pointing at the sun wasn''t such a good idea.</td>', 'You need to think about the composition a little more, the trees would have looked nicer if you didn''t have the house in-shot, and perhaps pointing at the sun wasn''t such a good idea.', '2008-09-08 22:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
