(4943768, 716488, 57229, '<td valign="top">Cenotaph? I don''t think the overexposure''s helped here. OK idea, though.</td>', 'Cenotaph? I don''t think the overexposure''s helped here. OK idea, though.', '2008-09-09 05:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943769, 717721, 57229, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of entries with ''heat'' in the title. I don''t think overexposure (with one or two noteable exceptions) conveys heat. It tends to give more of a cold light. Looks posed.</td>', 'There are a lot of entries with ''heat'' in the title. I don''t think overexposure (with one or two noteable exceptions) conveys heat. It tends to give more of a cold light. Looks posed.', '2008-09-09 05:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943771, 717651, 57229, '<td valign="top">Bad is what I is. I like the abstract here, but apart from a certain browny-pinkness I can''t really relate it to flesh. Looks more like paper. Nice composition, for a'' that...</td>', 'Bad is what I is. I like the abstract here, but apart from a certain browny-pinkness I can''t really relate it to flesh. Looks more like paper. Nice composition, for a'' that...', '2008-09-09 05:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943773, 717167, 57229, '<td valign="top">Disingenuous title confusion... I''m stuck for a comment - it is what it is and does ok at that... A dark frame or a silhouette, maybe, to contrast the unreal glow of things in the night.</td>', 'Disingenuous title confusion... I''m stuck for a comment - it is what it is and does ok at that... A dark frame or a silhouette, maybe, to contrast the unreal glow of things in the night.', '2008-09-09 05:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943775, 717587, 57229, '<td valign="top">Fair study of morning sunlight, but I''m not seeing this as overexposed so much as unevenly exposed...</td>', 'Fair study of morning sunlight, but I''m not seeing this as overexposed so much as unevenly exposed...', '2008-09-09 05:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943777, 716608, 57229, '<td valign="top">Sure not tempting to eat... Kiddy marketing uses this sort of effect though, maybe. It''s definitely overexposed :)</td>', 'Sure not tempting to eat... Kiddy marketing uses this sort of effect though, maybe. It''s definitely overexposed :)', '2008-09-09 05:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943780, 716046, 57229, '<td valign="top">This must be the challenge from hell - the beach is overexposed, the foam is overexposed, the woman isn''t...</td>', 'This must be the challenge from hell - the beach is overexposed, the foam is overexposed, the woman isn''t...', '2008-09-09 05:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943782, 717531, 57229, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, I guess, but it sort of falls between the smooth tones of a standard exposure and the graphic qualities of one that''s really overdone.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, I guess, but it sort of falls between the smooth tones of a standard exposure and the graphic qualities of one that''s really overdone.', '2008-09-09 05:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943784, 717170, 57229, '<td valign="top">This being a play on words, as the one portrayed has very little of their person exposed at all...</td>', 'This being a play on words, as the one portrayed has very little of their person exposed at all...', '2008-09-09 05:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943785, 717433, 57229, '<td valign="top">I think he means it... Not a patch on Larus''s hunting shot, but you really caught the attitude.</td>', 'I think he means it... Not a patch on Larus''s hunting shot, but you really caught the attitude.', '2008-09-09 05:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943786, 717204, 57229, '<td valign="top">Pity about the sharpness, but a great subject and well done for the light.</td>', 'Pity about the sharpness, but a great subject and well done for the light.', '2008-09-09 05:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943787, 717730, 57229, '<td valign="top">A play on words with the wood having been ''exposed'' to one thing or another? The rest of picture is not markedly overexposed - maybe over-saturated. I think maybe you''re trying for a dynamic, with the red flowers and the forlorn wood. It''s not really doing it for me, but god bless you for trying</td>', 'A play on words with the wood having been ''exposed'' to one thing or another? The rest of picture is not markedly overexposed - maybe over-saturated. I think maybe you''re trying for a dynamic, with the red flowers and the forlorn wood. It''s not really doing it for me, but god bless you for trying', '2008-09-09 05:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943789, 717183, 57229, '<td valign="top">Exactly, and it works. I have my petty reservation about the crop, but the graphic effect has really come through...</td>', 'Exactly, and it works. I have my petty reservation about the crop, but the graphic effect has really come through...', '2008-09-09 05:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943790, 716347, 57229, '<td valign="top">This works - adds to the hardness of the action...</td>', 'This works - adds to the hardness of the action...', '2008-09-09 05:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943791, 717727, 57229, '<td valign="top">I''d say over-saturation rather than overexposure.</td>', 'I''d say over-saturation rather than overexposure.', '2008-09-09 05:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943792, 717248, 57229, '<td valign="top">Says little, but benefits from overexposure, which was the challenge... :)</td>', 'Says little, but benefits from overexposure, which was the challenge... :)', '2008-09-09 05:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943795, 717226, 57229, '<td valign="top">I think maybe I''d have gone for an ever so slightly less tight crop, but the graphic effect is working very well.</td>', 'I think maybe I''d have gone for an ever so slightly less tight crop, but the graphic effect is working very well.', '2008-09-09 05:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
