(4943799, 716635, 57229, '<td valign="top">There have been a few of these, understandably. This isn''t the best but it''s far way off the worst :) I think the voting (especially if it follows my own confusion) may be torn between the success of retaining softness in the flesh and the failure to produce a completely distinct graphic. It gets better when you look at it longer and that''s never a good sign for votes :)</td>', 'There have been a few of these, understandably. This isn''t the best but it''s far way off the worst :) I think the voting (especially if it follows my own confusion) may be torn between the success of retaining softness in the flesh and the failure to produce a completely distinct graphic. It gets better when you look at it longer and that''s never a good sign for votes :)', '2008-09-09 05:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943800, 717592, 57229, '<td valign="top">Can''t really give it a title when it''s not about anything...</td>', 'Can''t really give it a title when it''s not about anything...', '2008-09-09 05:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
