(4944839, 717565, 95104, '<td valign="top">Magnificent</td>', 'Magnificent', '2008-09-09 17:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944935, 716502, 57229, '<td valign="top">Die the hair dark before you do this kind of shot. Really that''s elementary photography...<br/>OK that was a feeble joke. Even so, while the eye is (very) good, I think it''s just too much off to one side while the rest of the picture is washed out. I know it has to be washed out on account of the overexposure, but I think it''s a composition thing - the white out left is perhaps unnecessary and you could maybe have done a little juggling, bringing the iris onto a thirds conjunction. <br/>Great impact in a small section of the picture :)</td>', 'Die the hair dark before you do this kind of shot. Really that''s elementary photography...OK that was a feeble joke. Even so, while the eye is (very) good, I think it''s just too much off to one side while the rest of the picture is washed out. I know it has to be washed out on account of the overexposure, but I think it''s a composition thing - the white out left is perhaps unnecessary and you could maybe have done a little juggling, bringing the iris onto a thirds conjunction. Great impact in a small section of the picture :)', '2008-09-09 18:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944945, 717736, 57229, '<td valign="top">This works well. It does look as though the eyes are underexposed (!), but ain''t that the way it goes. I also have a feeling there''s a little too much softness or blur there - but I''m only saying that because I think this could have the makings of a great picture and it might be worth trying to improve on it.</td>', 'This works well. It does look as though the eyes are underexposed (!), but ain''t that the way it goes. I also have a feeling there''s a little too much softness or blur there - but I''m only saying that because I think this could have the makings of a great picture and it might be worth trying to improve on it.', '2008-09-09 18:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944949, 715260, 57229, '<td valign="top">Nice pose/expression. Heh. I was sure I would slate this from the thumbnail, but it works.</td>', 'Nice pose/expression. Heh. I was sure I would slate this from the thumbnail, but it works.', '2008-09-09 18:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944955, 717611, 57229, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture - doesn''t look particularly overexposed to me though. I bet this looks really well oversized...</td>', 'Lovely texture - doesn''t look particularly overexposed to me though. I bet this looks really well oversized...', '2008-09-09 18:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
