(4945420, 717669, 75532, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I saw a movie once called Cube, in the end one guy walks into a room filled with a super bright light - no sign of anything, just a mystery you know, and then the movie ends.  This reminds me of that.  I like the fact that his hands are not in focus it gives it a dreamy like feel 8</td>', 'I really like this.  I saw a movie once called Cube, in the end one guy walks into a room filled with a super bright light - no sign of anything, just a mystery you know, and then the movie ends.  This reminds me of that.  I like the fact that his hands are not in focus it gives it a dreamy like feel 8', '2008-09-09 22:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
