(4945496, 717565, 45475, '<td valign="top">Geez, you''re a master at this. Those eyes are doll-like indeed. I like the tilted pose, the directness of the gaze, the crop and the borders to polish it off. But the one thing that bugs me a little is, oddly enough, the very thing that was required for the challenge. With the loss of detail in the eyebrow and the line under the eye, there''s a strange illusion of the right eye being smaller than the left. Really just a minor issue for me, and this is still an exquisite, intimate child portrait. Kudos.</td>', 'Geez, you''re a master at this. Those eyes are doll-like indeed. I like the tilted pose, the directness of the gaze, the crop and the borders to polish it off. But the one thing that bugs me a little is, oddly enough, the very thing that was required for the challenge. With the loss of detail in the eyebrow and the line under the eye, there''s a strange illusion of the right eye being smaller than the left. Really just a minor issue for me, and this is still an exquisite, intimate child portrait. Kudos.', '2008-09-09 22:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4945502, 715536, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wonder if a narrower, vertical crop would have made a difference here. Something about the square crop just makes the composition look empty. Still, this is simply superb imagery. Love the water, the light and the wonderful lead in.</td>', 'Wonder if a narrower, vertical crop would have made a difference here. Something about the square crop just makes the composition look empty. Still, this is simply superb imagery. Love the water, the light and the wonderful lead in.', '2008-09-09 22:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
