(4946272, 716416, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dr.Confuser:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dr.Confuser:</b></div><hr/><i> imho, it would be better w/o the [explitive deleted] wings. You ruined an otherwise wonderful photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Gee thanks for your informative comment! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Judi, I respect you and your work which is often extraordinary, but in this case the wings just seem ... I don''t know ... unnecessary. We see quite a few winged models and mostly I just don''t resonate with those photos. Maybe I just like a less staged, less posed, less constructed photo. Doesn''t mean I''m right, but it''s the way I feel. It''s my opinion and I expressed it directly in my comment. <br/> <br/>You clearly didn''t appreciate my comment ... <u><b>I am truly sorry if I offended you.</b></u> <br/> <br/>But, on the other hand, I don''t particularly appreciate your glib sarcasm. You surely have enough cred here and self confidence to shrug off a direct negative comment from time to time. If you can''t take the heat, then get out of the kitchen, but don''t belittle my comment just because you don''t agree.<br/> <br/>And in the mean time, I''ll try to soften my tone in the comments I write. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I respect your comment as your opinion.  But the (expletive deleted) part was not necessary to get your point across....especially as this was based on a fairies realm...therefore a fairy is required to complete the picture.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Dr.Confuser: Originally posted by Judi: Originally posted by Dr.Confuser: imho, it would be better w/o the [explitive deleted] wings. You ruined an otherwise wonderful photo.   Gee thanks for your informative comment!   Judi, I respect you and your work which is often extraordinary, but in this case the wings just seem ... I don''t know ... unnecessary. We see quite a few winged models and mostly I just don''t resonate with those photos. Maybe I just like a less staged, less posed, less constructed photo. Doesn''t mean I''m right, but it''s the way I feel. It''s my opinion and I expressed it directly in my comment.  You clearly didn''t appreciate my comment ... I am truly sorry if I offended you.  But, on the other hand, I don''t particularly appreciate your glib sarcasm. You surely have enough cred here and self confidence to shrug off a direct negative comment from time to time. If you can''t take the heat, then get out of the kitchen, but don''t belittle my comment just because you don''t agree. And in the mean time, I''ll try to soften my tone in the comments I write.   I respect your comment as your opinion.  But the (expletive deleted) part was not necessary to get your point across....especially as this was based on a fairies realm...therefore a fairy is required to complete the picture. ', '2008-09-10 03:13:55.000000', NULL, 0),
