(4979750, 717677, 72096, '<td valign="top">Mr Dirt Diver...I have seen your work and I appreciate your comments.  I certainly did not put the time and energy to get the picture I had in mind. I was not expecting high praise for the shot, and quite frankly, regret submitting it because it turned out to be the lowest scoring picture I have submitted so far.  <br/>Politics and religion can become very ugly because people can be very passionate about thier point of views...as I am for mine.  I was not trying to push a political agenda when I posted this shot.  As I stated in the forum, you should ask yourself if the picture would be as offensive to some people if it was of a little blonde girl and the picture was titled Baby Hillary.  I am not a Hillary supporter but I would not try to bash on the subject... and I probably wouldn''t find it to be particularly "Political" either.</td>', 'Mr Dirt Diver...I have seen your work and I appreciate your comments.  I certainly did not put the time and energy to get the picture I had in mind. I was not expecting high praise for the shot, and quite frankly, regret submitting it because it turned out to be the lowest scoring picture I have submitted so far.  Politics and religion can become very ugly because people can be very passionate about thier point of views...as I am for mine.  I was not trying to push a political agenda when I posted this shot.  As I stated in the forum, you should ask yourself if the picture would be as offensive to some people if it was of a little blonde girl and the picture was titled Baby Hillary.  I am not a Hillary supporter but I would not try to bash on the subject... and I probably wouldn''t find it to be particularly "Political" either.', '2008-09-29 02:55:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4985922, 717653, 62187, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo one of your 9''s: the highest score this photo recieved. Even though it is a photo that I did not care for very much, I voted it high because I thought it fit the challenge well. Many voters must have not seen your intent: I don''t like when that happens. So, I''m saving it as a ''Favorite Photo'' so I can remember what a ''Secret Smile'' is. The funny part is that one never knows why they are exactly smiling - sorry...</td>', 'I gave this photo one of your 9''s: the highest score this photo recieved. Even though it is a photo that I did not care for very much, I voted it high because I thought it fit the challenge well. Many voters must have not seen your intent: I don''t like when that happens. So, I''m saving it as a ''Favorite Photo'' so I can remember what a ''Secret Smile'' is. The funny part is that one never knows why they are exactly smiling - sorry...', '2008-10-01 22:34:56.000000', NULL, 0),
